    "title": "King City History Center to offer downtown walking tour in May - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Report ,\n1 days ago KING CITY — An event titled “History, Food and Fun” is planned Friday, May 1, featuring stories of King City’s history along with food samples from local restaurants. This will be one of the first tours hosted by the recently opened King City History Center at 110 North Vanderhurst Ave. next to the Downtown Plaza. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
